   "slug": "gram:gp-69",
   "variants": [],
   "steps_unavailable": "Invariable pre-predicate adverb, not a derivation from a base. The record is precise about position (とうとう stands before the verb, usually in the 〜た past: とうとう完成した, and it also accepts a negative predicate: とうとう来なかった), but it attaches to nothing and the closed op set has only append and no prepend, so no ordered build sequence can place the とうとう slot. Steps covering only the past-tense half would emit 完成した as if it were the pattern.",
   "nuance_tags": [
    "completion"
   ],
   "usage_contexts": [
