   "steps_unavailable": "Closed-class prenominal demonstrative, not a productive derivation. The record describes そういう (with こういう／ああいう／どういう) as a crystallized そう言う block that does not conjugate and stands BEFORE the noun it qualifies (そういう人); the noun itself undergoes no change, and the closed op set has only append and no prepend, so no ordered step sequence can produce the pattern from a base.",
   "nuance_tags": [],
   "usage_contexts": [
