    "written"
   ]
  },
  {
   "slug": "gram:gp-74",
   "variants": [],
   "steps_unavailable": "Circumfix built on a pre-predicate adverb. The record is precise (ぜんぜん sits before what is negated and the predicate goes negative: verb 〜ない／〜ません, i-adjective 〜くない, na-adjective／noun 〜じゃない・ではない), but the closed op set has only append and no prepend, so the ぜんぜん slot cannot be produced by an ordered build sequence. Steps covering only the negative half would emit 飲みません as if it were the pattern.",
   "nuance_tags": [
    "emphasis"
